{
  "id": "21677_insatsusuru",
  "headword": "{印刷|いんさつ}する",
  "reading": "いんさつする",
  "romaji": "insatsusuru",
  "part_of_speech": "suru verb",
  "gloss": "to print",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to print; to produce text or images on paper using a printer or printing press",
      "explanation": "Covers both commercial printing (books, newspapers) and everyday printing from a computer or phone."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "21677_insatsusuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "この{書類|しょるい}を{印刷|いんさつ}してください。",
      "english": "Please print this document.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "21677_insatsusuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{両面|りょうめん}{印刷|いんさつ}すると{紙|かみ}の{節約|せつやく}になる。",
      "english": "Printing on both sides saves paper.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "21677_insatsusuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{会議|かいぎ}の{資料|しりょう}を{十部|じゅうぶ}{印刷|いんさつ}しておいてもらえますか。",
      "english": "Could you print ten copies of the meeting materials?",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "The standard word for printing documents, photos, books, etc. Uses する to form the verb from the noun {印刷|いんさつ}.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {印刷|いんさつ}{物|ぶつ}: printed matter\n- {印刷|いんさつ}{機|き}: printing machine, press\n- カラー{印刷|いんさつ}: color printing\n- {両面|りょうめん}{印刷|いんさつ}: double-sided printing\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- プリントする: to print (more casual, often for home/office printing)\n- {出版|しゅっぱん}する: to publish (broader, includes editing and distribution)\n- コピーする: to copy/photocopy",
